{{wikipedia|Glagolitic alphabet}}
[[File:Glagolitic_alphabet.png|250px|thumb|The '''''Glagolitic''''' alphabet in round style.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Glagolithic}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|NL.|glagoliticus}}, from {{der|en|cu|глаголица}}, from {{m|cu|глаголъ||word, speech}}, Glagolitic spelling {{m|cu|ⰳⰾⰰⰳⱁⰾⰻⱌⰰ||sc=Glag}}.

